@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy information";
}

<section class="section-heading mb-4">
    <span class="eyebrow">PRIVACY INFORMATION</span>
    <h1 class="display-6 mt-2">Understand this prototype before using it</h1>
</section>

<div class="feature-card">
    <h2 class="h5">Demonstration data</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">This local demonstration stores account details and ambulance request information in its SQLite database so the example workflows can be tested.</p>
    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Do not enter real patient information</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">The application has not been assessed or approved for handling real health information. Use fictional details only. Do not rely on this prototype for emergency response, diagnosis, treatment, or secure health-data storage.</p>
    <h2 class="h5 mt-4">Local prototype only</h2>
    <p class="text-muted mb-0">This project does not send requests to a real Ministry of Health or emergency service. A deployment intended for real users would require an appropriate privacy notice, legal review, security assessment, and operational approvals.</p>
</div>
